le_name": "Untitled design (14).png", "id": "26507286155543160", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300678_26507286172209825_5695452597013670875_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=idv9hyjVdAgQ7kNvwEnMVB1&_nc_oc=Adr17hz-FycwN-GObVeMfPSOOI2tLMD9a9Pn9CVTz6TL_2nnuYy2uEdmC2tTDU5gHe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-g9ADB4eOjZPLVLALih0EZKQ6V_4TuWXQ0X48dResAew&oe=6A36BEB5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled design (4).png", "id": "1344230044390345", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_1344230051057011_9037583091754755675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aepRguQsFd8Q7kNvwFKNicJ&_nc_oc=AdqzI7BwovTUzdPkFTn9beIUPTL_RdHViNOrxF9e0icsyz--w9BAdx18LTXeP-hosD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87t2qyTduUMljyS_gQTzzsnK0O35r5JfknM0ZiAG-gPg&oe=6A36A02D"}, "display_name": "canopyXchaos", "keywords": [], "long_description": ". Refined Locomotion & Physics\nThe \"feel\" of a Gtag-style game is everything. Even if your movement is solid, constant updates are needed to:\n\nSurface-Specific Friction: Adding \"slippery\" ice walls, \"sticky\" honey or mud, and high-bounce trampolines to change how players navigate.\n\nHaptic Feedback Calibration: Fine-tuning the rumble in the controllers so every \"slap\" and \"jump\" feels impactful and distinct.\n\nCollision Optimization: Fixing those pesky spots where players get their hands stuck in a wall or \"clip\" through the floor.\n\n\ud83e\udde5 2. The Cosmetic & Economy Loop\nIf you want players to keep coming back, they need a reason to \"show off.\"\n\nSeasonal Item Rotations: Introducing limited-time hats, badges, or handheld items tied to real-world holidays (Halloween, Winter, Summer) or in-game \"lore\" events.\n\nPlayer Tiers & Rarity: Implementing \"OG\" badges for early supporters or \"Veteran\" skins that can only be earned through playtime, not just currency.\n\nParticle Effects: Adding \"trails\" or \"glows\" to high-tier items to make them true status symbols in the lobby.\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 3. Map Expansion & \"Biome\" Variety\nDon't just add more space; add more variety to the gameplay.\n\nVerticality-Focused Maps: Creating a \"Canyon\" or \"Skyscraper\" map that rewards high-risk jumps and punishes players who fall.\n\nDynamic Environments: Adding moving platforms, rising lava, or water mechanics (swimming is a huge trend in Gtag-likes!) to keep the \"taggers\" on their toes.\n\nThe \"Hub\" Evolution: Constantly updatin", "short_description": "This is a Gtag fangame with some ongoing updates in the works.....always"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DC1ngVpjsW-XYcvzW7hZn4LY2SLLMiDjrZ92qKT1OXM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RNG", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@RNGRIFFM-RNG", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "25872071449130028"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2582737224693328